  28:../../opus/celt/mdct.c **** 
  29:../../opus/celt/mdct.c **** /* This is a simple MDCT implementation that uses a N/4 complex FFT
  30:../../opus/celt/mdct.c ****    to do most of the work. It should be relatively straightforward to
ARM GAS  C:\Users\oleg\AppData\Local\Temp\ccR3EsjT.s 			page 2


  31:../../opus/celt/mdct.c ****    plug in pretty much and FFT here.
  32:../../opus/celt/mdct.c **** 
  33:../../opus/celt/mdct.c ****    This replaces the Vorbis FFT (and uses the exact same API), which
  34:../../opus/celt/mdct.c ****    was a bit too messy and that was ending up duplicating code
  35:../../opus/celt/mdct.c ****    (might as well use the same FFT everywhere).
  36:../../opus/celt/mdct.c **** 
  37:../../opus/celt/mdct.c ****    The algorithm is similar to (and inspired from) Fabrice Bellard's
  38:../../opus/celt/mdct.c ****    MDCT implementation in FFMPEG, but has differences in signs, ordering
  39:../../opus/celt/mdct.c ****    and scaling in many places.
  40:../../opus/celt/mdct.c **** */
  41:../../opus/celt/mdct.c **** 
